# ttser

Follow `AGENTS.md` in the repo root. Engine internals are in `s2.cpp/AGENTS.md`.

- Desktop PySide6 app; synthesis is ctypes → `libs2_*`, not HTTP.
- `s2.cpp` is an official GitHub submodule. Do not vendor it as a normal directory.
- Rebuild Flatpak plugins inside `org.freedesktop.Sdk//24.08`. Host `.so` files fail with `GLIBC_2.43 not found`.
- Qt `Signal(int)` is 32-bit. Never emit GGUF byte sizes; use percent + string for download progress.
- Closing settings must cancel model download and delete the `.part` file.
- Voice clone is optional (checkbox). Reference transcript is an internal `"."` placeholder.
- Show a GPU backend in the GUI only if its library file exists.
- When preparing UTF-8 text for ttser / Fish Audio S2 Pro (one line = one chunk), follow `.cursor/skills/ttser-s2-text-prep/SKILL.md`. Do not use that skill for other TTS engines.
